<!--
  ECAL support box for the 2025 Winter single-module vertical-slice test beam.
  Rebuilt parametrically from ECal_testBeam_Aug2025.STEP.
  Thin Aluminum skin panels, 8020 T-slot rails, and PlaneBracket plate-rest
  bars, grouped in an <assembly> (no enclosing air -> no overlap with the
  stack). Local frame: origin = box center, z = beam. ENTITY-included into
  ecal.gdml <structure>. Generated by generate_support_box.py (do not edit).
-->
